{"id":"n4-091","title":"～だろう (〜darou)","jlptLevel":4,"shortExplanation":"Express probability, likelihood or certainty; 'probably', 'maybe', 'I think'.","longExplanation":"The ～だろう grammar point is used to express probability, likelihood, or certainty about a situation or event. It can be translated as 'probably', 'maybe', or 'I think' in English. The formation differs depending on whether it is used with a verb, い-adjective, な-adjective, or noun.","formation":"Verb-casual + だろう, い-Adjective (drop い) + だろう, な-Adjective + だろう, Noun + だろう","examples":[{"jp":"明日は晴れるだろう。","romaji":"Ashita wa hareru darou.","en":"It will probably be sunny tomorrow.","words":[{"surface":"明日","vocabId":"1584660","reading":"あした"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"晴れる","vocabId":"1376470","reading":"はれる"},{"surface":"だろ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4]},{"jp":"彼は忙しいだろう。","romaji":"Kare wa isogashii darou.","en":"He is probably busy.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"忙しい","vocabId":"1519290","reading":"いそがしい"},{"surface":"だろ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4]},{"jp":"この本は面白いだろう。","romaji":"Kono hon wa omoshiroi darou.","en":"This book is probably interesting.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"本","vocabId":"1522150","reading":"ほん"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"面白い","vocabId":"1533580","reading":"おもしろい"},{"surface":"だろ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5]},{"jp":"彼女は先生だろう。","romaji":"Kanojo wa sensei darou.","en":"She is probably a teacher.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"先生","vocabId":"1387990","reading":"せんせい"},{"surface":"だろ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4]}],"formalityLevel":"casual","usageNote":"Casual conjecture - \"probably\", the plain-form counterpart of でしょう.","family":{"id":"inference","name":"Inference (It Seems / Probably)","relatedPoints":["n4-119","n3-118","n4-094"]}}